```typescript
const loadData = () => {}; // Or some other default value

useEffect(() => {
  loadData();
}, [loadData]);
```

4.  **Use a state variable to track initialization status:** Create a state variable to track whether `loadData` has been initialized.

```typescript
const [isLoadDataInitialized, setIsLoadDataInitialized] = useState(false);

const loadData = () => {
